The Mercedes-Benz GLC 250d refers to a diesel variant from the previous generation (X253, roughly 2016-2019 model years) of the GLC, as the current generation (X254) offers GLC 220d and 300d diesel options instead. I will evaluate based on the specifications of the X253 GLC 250d.

